{"strongs": "H6565", "word": "פָּרַר", "translit": "pa.rar", "root": "פרר", "morph": "H:V", "pos": "verb Hiph`il", "gloss": "break, frustrate", "definition": "[ פָּרַר ] verb Hiph`il break, frustrate (Late Hebrew Pi`el crumble ; Jewish-Aramaic פְּרַר ; Assyrian parâru , destroy ; II. shatter ; Lihyanian והפרו destroy , DHM Epigr. Denkm., No. 21, 7 ); — Perfect 3 masculine singular הֵפֵר Isa 33:8 +, הֵפַ֑ר Gen 17:14 ; Num 15:31 also metaplastic from הֵפִיר Ezek 17:19 ; Ps 33:10 ( Ges «GKC:67v»§ 67v ); 2 masculine singular וְהֵפַרְדָמתּ֫ה 2Sam 15:34 , etc., Imperfect 3 masculine singular יָפֵר Num 30:13 +, וַיָּפֶר Neh 4:9 , etc.; also 1 singular אָפִיר Ps 89:34 ( Ges i.c .); Imperative masculine singular הָפֵר 2Chr 16:3 ; Ps 85:5 , הָפֵרָה 1Kgs 15:19 Infinitive absolute הָפֵר Prov 15:22 +; construct לְהָפֵר 2Sam 17:14 +, לְהָפֵיר Zech 11:10 , suffix לְהַפְרְכֶם Lev 26:15 ( Ges «GKC:67dd»§ 67dd ); Participle מֵפֵר Isa 44:25 ; Job 5:12 — 1. break, violate , especially with accusative בְּרִית : \\ \\ a. of ׳ י Judg 2:1 ; Jer 14:21 ; Lev 26:44 ; Zech 11:10 . \\ \\ b. of men violating covenant with ׳ י Jer 11:10 ; Jer 31:32 ; Deut 31:16 ; Deut 31:20 ; Lev 26:15 ; Ezek 44:7 ; Gen 17:14 ; Isa 24:5 compare Jer 33:20 . \\ \\ c. of men breaking compact, league (with men), Isa 33:8 ; 1Kgs 15:19 = 2Chr 16:3 ; Ezek 17:15 ; Ezek 17:16 ; Ezek 17:18 ; Ezek 17:19 . \\ \\ d. of destroying the אַחֲוָה between Judah and Israel Zech 11:14 . \\ \\ e. of breaking ׳ י 's מִצְוָה Num 15:31 ; Ezra 9:14 , תּוֺרָה Ps 119:126 . 2. frustrate, make ineffectual: : \\ \\ a. counsel ( עֵצָה ) 2Sam 15:34 ; 2Sam 17:14 ; Ezra 4:5 ׳ י subject Neh 4:9 ; Ps 33:10 of man frustrating ׳ י 's counsel Isa 14:27 , so, with accusative מִשְׁפָּט Job 40:8 with accusative מַחֲשָׁבוֺת in general, of men Prov 15:22 , ׳ י subject Job 15:12 so, with accusative אֹתוֺת Isa 44:25 . \\ \\ b. make vow ( נֶדֶר ) ineffectual, annul it Num 30:9 ; Num 30:14 (opposed to חֵקִים ), v. Num 30:13 , also (Imperfect + Infinitive absolute) v. Num 30:13 ; Num 30:16 . \\ \\ c. of annulling (godly) fear Job 15:4 חַסְדִּי לֹא אָפִיר מֵעִמּוֺ , Ps 89:34 read probably אָסִיר Ol Che Bae and others; הָפֵר כַּעַסְךָ Ps 85:4 (read הָסֵר ᵐ5 Bi Che ). \\ \\ d. וְתָפֵר הָאֲבֵיּוֺנָה Eccl 12:5 is dubious: De Wild and others fails (to excite [? וְתֻפַר Hoph`al is made ineffectual ]); Ew bursts ( Siegf וְתֻפַר ); but caper-berry not dehiscent ( Post Flora of Syr. 106 ff. ); M'Lean-Dyer Ency. Bid. 696. ): Post Letter, July 28, 1901 breaks up (by shrivelling), figurative of failing sexual power; Aq from פרה bear fruit (compare GFM JBL x (1891), 60 ); Perles Anal. 30 וְתִפְרַח . Hoph`al Imperfect 1. be frustratred , 3 feminine singular וְתֻפָ֑ר Isa 8:10 (of עֵצָה ). 2. be broken , of covenant, 3 feminine singular תֻּפַר Jer 33:21 וִתֻּפַר Zech 11:11 so Isa 28:18 (read וְתֻפַר for וְכֻפַּר , see ׳ כ ). Pilpel Imperfect 3 masculine singular suffix וַיְפַרְפְּרֵנִי Job 16:12 he hath shattered me.", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB6817')\">BDB6817</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H6331')\">H6331</entry> <entry onclick=\"sn('H6565')\">H6565</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB6816')\">BDB6816</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB6818')\">BDB6818</entry></div><p> [<bdbheb>פָּרַר</bdbheb>] <b>verb Hiph`il</b> <highlightword>break, frustrate</highlightword> (Late Hebrew Pi`el <highlight>crumble</highlight>; Jewish-Aramaic <bdbarc>פְּרַר</bdbarc>; Assyrian <transliteration><highlight>parâru</highlight></transliteration>, <highlight>destroy</highlight>; II. <highlight>shatter</highlight>; Lihyanian <bdbheb>והפרו</bdbheb> <highlight>destroy</highlight>, <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('DHM')\">DHM<sup>Epigr. Denkm., No. 21, 7</sup></lookup>); — <highlight>Perfect</highlight> 3 masculine singular <bdbheb>הֵפֵר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 33:8\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"33\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"33\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(23,33,8)\">Isa 33:8</ref> +, <bdbheb>הֵפַ֑ר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 17:14\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(1,17,14)\">Gen 17:14</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 15:31\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"31\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"31\" onclick=\"bcv(4,15,31)\">Num 15:31</ref> also metaplastic from <bdbheb>הֵפִיר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 17:19\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(26,17,19)\">Ezek 17:19</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 33:10\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"33\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"33\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(19,33,10)\">Ps 33:10</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Ges')\">Ges</lookup><sup>«GKC:67v»§ 67v</sup>); 2 masculine singular <bdbheb>וְהֵפַרְדָמתּ֫ה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Sam 15:34\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"34\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"34\" onclick=\"bcv(10,15,34)\">2Sam 15:34</ref>, etc., <highlight>Imperfect</highlight> 3 masculine singular <bdbheb>יָפֵר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Num 30:13\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(4,30,13)\">Num 30:13</ref> +, <bdbheb>וַיָּפֶר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Neh 4:9\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(16,4,9)\">Neh 4:9</ref>, etc.; also 1 singular <bdbheb>אָפִיר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 89:34\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"89\" vBegin=\"34\" cEnd=\"89\" vEnd=\"34\" onclick=\"bcv(19,89,34)\">Ps 89:34</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Ges')\">Ges<sup>i.c</sup></lookup>.); <highlight>Imperative</highlight> masculine singular <bdbheb>הָפֵר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Chr 16:3\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(14,16,3)\">2Chr 16:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 85:5\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"85\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"85\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(19,85,5)\">Ps 85:5</ref>, <bdbheb>הָפֵרָה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Kgs 15:19\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(11,15,19)\">1Kgs 15:19</ref> <highlight>Infinitive</highlight> absolute <bdbheb>הָפֵר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Prov 15:22\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(20,15,22)\">Prov 15:22</ref> +; construct <bdbheb>לְהָפֵר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Sam 17:14\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(10,17,14)\">2Sam 17:14</ref> +, <bdbheb>לְהָפֵיר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Zech 11:10\" b=\"38\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(38,11,10)\">Zech 11:10</ref>, suffix <bdbheb>לְהַפְרְכֶם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Lev 26:15\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(3,26,15)\">Lev 26:15</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Ges')\">Ges</lookup><sup>«GKC:67dd»§ 67dd</sup>); <highlight>Participle</highlight> <bdbheb>מֵפֵר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 44:25\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"44\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"44\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(23,44,25)\">Isa 44:25</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 5:12\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(18,5,12)\">Job 5:12</ref> — <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> <highlight>break, violate</highlight>, especially with accusative <bdbheb>בְּרִית</bdbheb>: <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>a.</b> of <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Judg 2:1\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(7,2,1)\">Judg 2:1</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 14:21\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(24,14,21)\">Jer 14:21</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lev 26:44\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"44\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"44\" onclick=\"bcv(3,26,44)\">Lev 26:44</ref>; <ref ref=\"Zech 11:10\" b=\"38\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(38,11,10)\">Zech 11:10</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> of men violating covenant with <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 11:10\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(24,11,10)\">Jer 11:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 31:32\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"32\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"32\" onclick=\"bcv(24,31,32)\">Jer 31:32</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 31:16\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(5,31,16)\">Deut 31:16</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 31:20\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(5,31,20)\">Deut 31:20</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lev 26:15\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(3,26,15)\">Lev 26:15</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 44:7\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"44\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"44\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(26,44,7)\">Ezek 44:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 17:14\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(1,17,14)\">Gen 17:14</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 24:5\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(23,24,5)\">Isa 24:5</ref> compare <ref ref=\"Jer 33:20\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"33\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"33\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(24,33,20)\">Jer 33:20</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>c.</b> of men breaking compact, league (with men), <ref ref=\"Isa 33:8\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"33\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"33\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(23,33,8)\">Isa 33:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Kgs 15:19\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(11,15,19)\">1Kgs 15:19</ref> = <ref ref=\"2Chr 16:3\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(14,16,3)\">2Chr 16:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 17:15\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(26,17,15)\">Ezek 17:15</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 17:16\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(26,17,16)\">Ezek 17:16</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 17:18\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(26,17,18)\">Ezek 17:18</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 17:19\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(26,17,19)\">Ezek 17:19</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>d.</b> of destroying the <bdbheb>אַחֲוָה</bdbheb> between Judah and Israel <ref ref=\"Zech 11:14\" b=\"38\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(38,11,14)\">Zech 11:14</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>e.</b> of breaking <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb>'s <bdbheb>מִצְוָה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Num 15:31\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"31\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"31\" onclick=\"bcv(4,15,31)\">Num 15:31</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezra 9:14\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(15,9,14)\">Ezra 9:14</ref>, <bdbheb>תּוֺרָה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 119:126\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"119\" vBegin=\"126\" cEnd=\"119\" vEnd=\"126\" onclick=\"bcv(19,119,126)\">Ps 119:126</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> <highlight>frustrate, make ineffectual:</highlight>: <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>a.</b> counsel (<bdbheb>עֵצָה</bdbheb>) <ref ref=\"2Sam 15:34\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"34\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"34\" onclick=\"bcv(10,15,34)\">2Sam 15:34</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Sam 17:14\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(10,17,14)\">2Sam 17:14</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezra 4:5\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(15,4,5)\">Ezra 4:5</ref> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb> subject <ref ref=\"Neh 4:9\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(16,4,9)\">Neh 4:9</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 33:10\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"33\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"33\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(19,33,10)\">Ps 33:10</ref> of man frustrating <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb>'s counsel <ref ref=\"Isa 14:27\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(23,14,27)\">Isa 14:27</ref>, so, with accusative <bdbheb>מִשְׁפָּט</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 40:8\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"40\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"40\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(18,40,8)\">Job 40:8</ref> with accusative <bdbheb>מַחֲשָׁבוֺת</bdbheb> in general, of men <ref ref=\"Prov 15:22\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(20,15,22)\">Prov 15:22</ref>, <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb> subject <ref ref=\"Job 15:12\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(18,15,12)\">Job 15:12</ref> so, with accusative <bdbheb>אֹתוֺת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 44:25\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"44\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"44\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(23,44,25)\">Isa 44:25</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> <highlight>make</highlight> vow (<bdbheb>נֶדֶר</bdbheb>) <highlight>ineffectual, annul</highlight> it <ref ref=\"Num 30:9\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(4,30,9)\">Num 30:9</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 30:14\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(4,30,14)\">Num 30:14</ref> (opposed to <bdbheb>חֵקִים</bdbheb>), v.<ref ref=\"Num 30:13\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(4,30,13)\">Num 30:13</ref>, also (Imperfect + Infinitive absolute) v.<ref ref=\"Num 30:13\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(4,30,13)\">Num 30:13</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 30:16\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(4,30,16)\">Num 30:16</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>c.</b> of annulling (godly) fear <ref ref=\"Job 15:4\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(18,15,4)\">Job 15:4</ref> <bdbheb>חַסְדִּי לֹא אָפִיר מֵעִמּוֺ</bdbheb>, <ref ref=\"Ps 89:34\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"89\" vBegin=\"34\" cEnd=\"89\" vEnd=\"34\" onclick=\"bcv(19,89,34)\">Ps 89:34</ref> read probably <bdbheb>אָסִיר</bdbheb> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Ol')\">Ol</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Che')\">Che</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Bae')\">Bae</lookup> and others; <bdbheb>הָפֵר כַּעַסְךָ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 85:4\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"85\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"85\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(19,85,4)\">Ps 85:4</ref> (read <bdbheb>הָסֵר</bdbheb> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Bi')\">Bi</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Che')\">Che</lookup>). <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>d.</b> <bdbheb>וְתָפֵר הָאֲבֵיּוֺנָה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Eccl 12:5\" b=\"21\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(21,12,5)\">Eccl 12:5</ref> is dubious: <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('De')\">De</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Wild')\">Wild</lookup> and others <highlight>fails</highlight> (to excite [? <bdbheb>וְתֻפַר</bdbheb> <b>Hoph`al</b> <highlight>is made ineffectual</highlight>]); <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Ew')\">Ew</lookup> <highlight>bursts</highlight> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Siegf')\">Siegf</lookup> <bdbheb>וְתֻפַר</bdbheb>); but caper-berry not dehiscent (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Post')\">Post<sup>Flora of Syr. 106 ff.</sup></lookup>); M'Lean-Dyer<sup>Ency. Bid. 696.</sup>): <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Post')\">Post<sup>Letter, July 28, 1901</sup></lookup> <highlight>breaks up</highlight> (by shrivelling), figurative of failing sexual power; <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Aq')\"><reflink>Aq</reflink></lookup> from <bdbheb>פרה</bdbheb> <highlight>bear fruit</highlight> (compare <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('GFM')\">GFM<sup>JBL x (1891), 60</sup></lookup>); <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Perles')\">Perles<sup>Anal. 30</sup></lookup> <bdbheb>וְתִפְרַח</bdbheb>. <b>Hoph`al</b> <highlight>Imperfect</highlight> </div><div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> <highlight>be frustratred</highlight>, 3 feminine singular <bdbheb>וְתֻפָ֑ר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 8:10\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(23,8,10)\">Isa 8:10</ref> (of <bdbheb>עֵצָה</bdbheb>). </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> <highlight>be broken</highlight>, of covenant, 3 feminine singular <bdbheb>תֻּפַר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 33:21\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"33\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"33\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(24,33,21)\">Jer 33:21</ref> <bdbheb>וִתֻּפַר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Zech 11:11\" b=\"38\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(38,11,11)\">Zech 11:11</ref> so <ref ref=\"Isa 28:18\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(23,28,18)\">Isa 28:18</ref> (read <bdbheb>וְתֻפַר</bdbheb> for <bdbheb>וְכֻפַּר</bdbheb>, see <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>כ</bdbheb>). <b>Pilpel</b> <highlight>Imperfect</highlight> 3 masculine singular suffix <bdbheb>וַיְפַרְפְּרֵנִי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 16:12\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(18,16,12)\">Job 16:12</ref> <highlight>he hath shattered me. </highlight></p></div><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Isa 33:8", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 33, "verse": 8}, {"raw": "Gen 17:14", "book": "GEN", "chapter": 17, "verse": 14}, {"raw": "Num 15:31", "book": "NUM", "chapter": 15, "verse": 31}, {"raw": "Ezek 17:19", "book": "EZK", "chapter": 17, "verse": 19}, {"raw": "Ps 33:10", "book": "PSA", "chapter": 33, "verse": 10}, {"raw": "2Sam 15:34", "book": "2SA", "chapter": 15, "verse": 34}, {"raw": "Num 30:13", "book": "NUM", "chapter": 30, "verse": 13}, {"raw": "Neh 4:9", "book": "NEH", "chapter": 4, "verse": 9}, {"raw": "Ps 89:34", "book": "PSA", "chapter": 89, "verse": 34}, {"raw": "2Chr 16:3", "book": "2CH", "chapter": 16, "verse": 3}, {"raw": "Ps 85:5", "book": "PSA", "chapter": 85, "verse": 5}, {"raw": "1Kgs 15:19", "book": "1KI", "chapter": 15, "verse": 19}, {"raw": "Prov 15:22", "book": "PRO", "chapter": 15, "verse": 22}, {"raw": "2Sam 17:14", "book": "2SA", "chapter": 17, "verse": 14}, {"raw": "Zech 11:10", "book": "ZEC", "chapter": 11, "verse": 10}, {"raw": "Lev 26:15", "book": "LEV", "chapter": 26, "verse": 15}, {"raw": "Isa 44:25", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 44, "verse": 25}, {"raw": "Job 5:12", "book": "JOB", "chapter": 5, "verse": 12}, {"raw": "Judg 2:1", "book": "JDG", "chapter": 2, "verse": 1}, {"raw": "Jer 14:21", "book": "JER", "chapter": 14, "verse": 21}, {"raw": "Lev 26:44", "book": "LEV", "chapter": 26, "verse": 44}, {"raw": "Jer 11:10", "book": "JER", "chapter": 11, "verse": 10}, {"raw": "Jer 31:32", "book": "JER", "chapter": 31, "verse": 32}, {"raw": "Deut 31:16", "b